diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 9806b52..48bb2c5 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -9,6 +9,8 @@ ## [Unreleased]
 
 ### Added
 
+- Entities and memberships: `entities` (slug routing, soft deletes) and `entity_memberships` (roles `owner`/`admin`/`employee`). The database rejects a second owner per entity through a stored generated `owner_seq` column and a unique index, on SQLite and MariaDB alike. Policies `EntityPolicy` and `EntityMembershipPolicy`.
+- Entity pages under `/e/{entity:slug}`: `entity.pick` stores the current entity in the session (audited), and Livewire pages for the dashboard, members (add, assign role, remove) and owner-only settings (edit name and slug, delete, transfer ownership).
 - Database schema and Mermaid diagram in [`docs/database-schema.md`](docs/database-schema.md).
 - Business rules documentation in [`docs/business-rules.md`](docs/business-rules.md): MVP queue management, entity/subscription, roles (admin, owner, employee), tickets, priorities, fairness (3-ticket rule), deterministic call panel, and channels (Flutter totem, web TV, attendant).
 - This changelog (Keep a Changelog).
